      "releaseNotes": "Better RPG Maker MV/MZ support, new ways to import and patch games, and a new cheat.\n\nNEW\n• God Mode (beta) for RPG Maker MV/MZ — take no damage and heal your party when enabled\n• Install and remove MV/MZ content patches from Game Details\n• The Zip file with single-file .exe games can now be imported directly (beta)\n\nFIXES\n• Fixed crashes when opening menus, saving, or changing maps in some MV games\n• MV/MZ saves are now stored immediately, so progress survives crashes or force-closing Runa\n• Fixed several MV/MZ games failing to start or getting stuck loading\n• Fixed stretched screens and accidental scrolling in MV/MZ games\n• Improved support for bundled saves and more game folder layouts\n• A game's Exit command now returns to the Runa library\n• Classic RPG Maker cheats can now change item counts\n• Game errors are now included in diagnostics logs",
      "version": "1.3.9",
